    "WITH vs WITHOUT\n\nBoth samplers share the seed, latent, and negative. The only difference\nis the positive conditioning: sliders vs none.\n\nTry: set all six sliders to 0 and queue - the two images match exactly.\nThen drag brightness to +3 and watch only the left image change."
